    "macOS declined access to Claude Code's login in the Keychain. Enable it again to retry.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS hat den Zugriff auf die Claude-Code-Anmeldung im Schlüsselbund verweigert. Aktiviere es erneut, um es nochmal zu versuchen."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS denegó el acceso a la sesión de Claude Code en el Llavero. Vuelve a activarlo para reintentarlo."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS a refusé l'accès à la connexion Claude Code dans le trousseau. Réactivez-le pour réessayer."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS ha negato l'accesso all'accesso di Claude Code nel Portachiavi. Riattivalo per riprovare."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS がキーチェーン内の Claude Code のログインへのアクセスを拒否しました。もう一度有効にしてください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS가 키체인의 Claude Code 로그인 접근을 거부했습니다. 다시 켜서 재시도하세요."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "O macOS negou acesso ao login do Claude Code nas Chaves. Ative novamente para tentar de novo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "macOS 拒绝访问钥匙串中的 Claude Code 登录。请重新启用以重试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS wouldn't share Claude Code's login with CocoNotch (Keychain error %d). Try enabling it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
